# A declared common: is a namespace like any other: one common.ttl, holding common:Shared, listed
# once in the manifest. The name is not reserved for the unmatched module.
@prefix common: <http://example.org/shared#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

common:Shared a owl:Class .

<http://example.org/other#Other> a owl:Class .
